          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Restrict this registration to the named phases. By default a system takes part in every phase whose method it defines, which is what almost every system wants. Pass this when an object happens to carry a method that shares a phase name without meaning to be that phase — the engine's own core managers expose a public update() for driving them manually, but participate only in preUpdate. Naming a phase the system does not implement is ignored."
